{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34743","headline":"贲中间有吴门旅泊之什蒙鲁望垂和更作一章以伸詶谢 · 张贲","name":"贲中间有吴门旅泊之什蒙鲁望垂和更作一章以伸詶谢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"偶发陶匏响，皆蒙组绣文。\n清秋将落帽，子夏正离羣。\n有恨书燕雁，无聊赋郢云。\n徧看心自醉，不是酒能醺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张贲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34743.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34743","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}